### Implementing Retry Logic for Transient Errors

Source: https://github.com/omise/omise-dotnet/blob/master/_autodocs/errors.md

Provides a mechanism to automatically retry API requests for specific transient errors like 'card_declined' or 'temporary_failure'. Includes exponential backoff for delays.

```csharp
public async Task<Charge> CreateChargeWithRetry(
    CreateChargeRequest request,
    int maxRetries = 3)
{
    int attempts = 0;
    OmiseError lastError = null;

    while (attempts < maxRetries)
    {
        try
        {
            return await client.Charges.Create(request);
        }
        catch (OmiseError ex)
        {
            lastError = ex;
            attempts++;

            // Only retry on specific errors
            if (ex.Code == "card_declined" || 
                ex.Code == "temporary_failure")
            {
                await Task.Delay(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(Math.Pow(2, attempts)));
                continue;
            }

            // Don't retry on invalid data
            throw;
        }
    }

    throw lastError;
}
```

--------------------------------

### Implement Rate Limiting Retry Logic

Source: https://github.com/omise/omise-dotnet/blob/master/_autodocs/errors.md

Implement a delay and retry mechanism for rate-limited requests. This checks for the 'too_many_requests' error code and waits for 60 seconds before retrying.

```csharp
if (ex.Code == "too_many_requests")
{
    // Wait and retry
    await Task.Delay(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(60));
    // Retry request
}
```

--------------------------------

### Create a Reusable Payment Link

Source: https://github.com/omise/omise-dotnet/blob/master/_autodocs/api-reference/LinkResource.md

To create a payment link that can be used multiple times, set the 'Multiple' property to true in the CreateLinkRequest. This is suitable for subscription services or recurring payments.

```csharp
var link = await client.Links.Create(new CreateLinkRequest
{
    Amount = 250000,
    Currency = "thb",
    Title = "Service Fee",
    Description = "Monthly service subscription",
    Multiple = true  // Allow multiple payments
});

// Can be shared and used multiple times
Console.WriteLine($"Subscription link: {link.PaymentUri}");
Console.WriteLine($"Payments received: {link.ChargesCount}");
```

--------------------------------

### List Recent Payment Links

Source: https://github.com/omise/omise-dotnet/blob/master/_autodocs/api-reference/LinkResource.md

Retrieves a list of recent payment links, sorted in descending order by creation date. Useful for displaying a history of payment links.

```csharp
var links = await client.Links.GetList(
    limit: 50,
    from: DateTime.Now.AddMonths(-1),
    order: Ordering.Desc
);

Console.WriteLine("Recent Payment Links:");
foreach (var link in links.Data)
{
    decimal amountDue = link.Amount - (link.ChargesAmount ?? 0);
    Console.WriteLine($"- {link.Title}");
    Console.WriteLine($"  Amount: {link.Amount / 100.00m} {link.Currency}");
    Console.WriteLine($"  Paid: {(link.ChargesAmount ?? 0) / 100.00m} {link.Currency}");
    Console.WriteLine($"  Outstanding: {amountDue / 100.00m} {link.Currency}");
    Console.WriteLine($"  Payments: {link.ChargesCount}");
    Console.WriteLine();
}
```

